talk(128,'1967-03-20','A. N. Parshin','P000202','Projective varieties: heading of the continued Mumford report','heading',r'''Only the handwritten date 20 March and the headings ``Continuation of Parshin's report'' and ``The case of projective varieties'' survive. The next visible mathematics is below a new date, 27 March, and concerns matrix factorization; it belongs to record 127. No theorem from Mumford's projective invariant theory is supplied by this heading. Catalogue source order is preserved even though record 128 has the earlier date.''')
